arish in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/louisiana/terrebonne-parish"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the parish record runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 13 grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 38 of them. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 48% of normal in August to September and 44% in both September to October and October to November. In 2026 so far the middle sat at 48% in January to February and 150% in May to June. Every grid listed had its driest year in 2023, and grid 10958 ran 52% of normal in 2023.</p>"}
